From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP contiguous-bar relocate + gap/region probe

Same-world Entity.teleportTo so a live corridor can empty. Landing pads
are collected from every cut group (empty halo no longer starves a side).
Probe reports gap_bands and ticking_regions; BLOCKS lockstep is not the bar.
Post-applyAllPatches.
